cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "lean-matrix-sos: A Lean formalization of matrix sum-of-squares factorization theorems"
authors:
  - given-names: "Mocho"
    family-names: "Go"
version: 0.1.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/selpoG/lean-matrix-sos"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - sum of squares
  - matrix polynomial
  - Hahn series
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of sums-of-squares factorization theorems for real
  symmetric univariate matrix polynomials, including degree-bounded full-line
  factorizations, Gram-matrix certificates, and interval and half-line variants.
